# ===========================================
# cunzhi 知识库保护规则
# ===========================================
# 说明：如果项目使用了 *.md 等通配符忽略规则，
# 必须添加以下例外以保护 .cunzhi-knowledge/ 目录

# 保护 cunzhi 知识库（独立 git 仓库）
!.cunzhi-knowledge/
!.cunzhi-knowledge/**
!.cunzhi-knowledge/**/*.md

# 保护 .windsurf 配置（workflows/skills）
!.windsurf/
!.windsurf/**
!.windsurf/**/*.md

# Keep only explicitly promoted durable memory files visible to Git.
!.cunzhi-memory/
.cunzhi-memory/**
!.cunzhi-memory/context.md
!.cunzhi-memory/metadata.json
!.cunzhi-memory/monitor-verify.md
!.cunzhi-memory/notes.md
!.cunzhi-memory/preferences.md
!.cunzhi-memory/rules.md
!.cunzhi-memory/sessions.md

# 如果项目有 *.json 忽略规则，也需要保护配置文件
!.cunzhi-knowledge/**/*.json

# Ignore large generated workflow raw line snapshots.
.cunzhi-memory/app-workflow-runs/**/pain-signals.user-lines

# Ignore generated local app workflow run artifacts. Durable findings belong in
# .cunzhi-knowledge; the run directories remain available locally for debugging.
.cunzhi-memory/app-workflow-runs/**

# Ignore volatile local run artifacts. Durable summaries should be promoted into
# tracked memory or .cunzhi-knowledge explicitly instead of committed wholesale.
.cunzhi-memory/runtime-logs/**
.cunzhi-memory/codex-room/**
.cunzhi-memory/auto-transport-runs/**
.cunzhi-memory/cpu-guard/**
.cunzhi-memory/mcp-response-channel-smoke-runs/**
.cunzhi-memory/public-stability-runs/**
.cunzhi-memory/release-parity-runs/**
.cunzhi-memory/**/*.pid
.cunzhi-memory/**/*.raw
.cunzhi-memory/**/*.err
.cunzhi-memory/**/*.log

# ===========================================
# 使用方式
# ===========================================
# 1. 检查项目 .gitignore 是否有 *.md 规则
# 2. 如果有，将上述规则添加到 .gitignore 末尾
# 3. 执行 git status 验证 .cunzhi-knowledge/ 文件可见
#
# 快速应用（在项目根目录执行）：
# cat .cunzhi-knowledge/templates/gitignore-cunzhi.txt >> .gitignore
#
# 验证：
# git status .cunzhi-knowledge/
# 应该显示文件变更，而不是被忽略
ios-bridge-dev/

